# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NvTerminal · environment
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in what you want.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Web search providers (optional) ──────────────────────────────────────────
# The search tool picks the first provider whose key is set, in this order:
#   1. Tavily  — recommended. LLM-native search, returns raw page content
#                and freshness-aware results.   https://tavily.com  (1000 free/mo)
#   2. Brave   — fast, generous free tier.      https://api.search.brave.com
#                                               (2000 free/mo)
#   3. (fallback) DuckDuckGo HTML scraping — no key, best-effort.
#
# Set one of:
# TAVILY_API_KEY=tvly-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# BRAVE_SEARCH_API_KEY=BSA-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
